//     STOP-TRIGGER (named, binding): pre-D1 authoring of
//     `emit_rust : Node -> Outcome<RustSource>` here would parallel-
//     represent the Outcome carrier across every language file —
//     exactly the v3 cross-layer-drift failure mode the
