//     Defer-with-named-trigger, never stub.
//
//   - Rust ownership / lifetime semantic enforcement (the borrow-
//     checker rules — single-owner, exclusive-mutable, lifetime
//     well-scopedness): the OWNERSHIP LENS lens/ownership.dag (T-13)
//     CONSUMES the `RustReference` carrier declared here as the
//     structural fact it reads. Per THESIS:401 IN-B "effects are
//     intrinsic to the type signature, not an annotation layer" —
//     `&` / `&mut` / `'a` are STRUCTURAL Rust facts, not annotations;
//     they are declared here as the type-system surface and READ by
